cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "H4C energy management model"
abstract: >-
  A two-stage stochastic optimisation model for the operational energy
  management scheduling of hubs for circularity (H4C), which can also be
  applied to multi-carrier energy and material networks. Written in Julia
  with JuMP. Developed as part of the IS2H4C project.
